ual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of <code>ExternT</code> characters necessary to produce one <code>InternT</code> character, if constant <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::codecvt&lt;InternT,ExternT,StateT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt/always_noconv\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_always_noconv</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  tests if the facet encodes an identity conversion for all valid argument values <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::codecvt&lt;InternT,ExternT,StateT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt/length\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_length</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  calculates the length of the <code>ExternT</code> string that would be consumed by conversion into given <code>InternT</code> buffer <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::codecvt&lt;InternT,ExternT,StateT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/codecvt/max_length\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_max_length</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the maximum number of <code>ExternT</code> characters that could be converted into a single <code>InternT</code> character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::codecvt&lt;InternT,ExternT,StateT&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-